The MIT grant above covers the source code, the shaders and the tools.

The sprite atlases under `assets/` are not hand-drawn: they are generated by
running `npm run build` over the models in `tools/models/`, which are part of
the source. They are covered by the same licence, so you may use them freely —
including the generated PNGs themselves.
